# Grab the Prize: "If the discarded card wasn't a land card, Grab the Prize deals 2 damage to each opponent." Bot1 discards an
# Island (a land card): it draws the Forest and the Swamp and Bot2 stays at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Grab the Prize
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Swamp
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
